<title>UK: Volkswagwen sets $200 mln five-year convertible.</title>
<headline>Volkswagwen sets $200 mln five-year convertible.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following exchangeable notes</p>
<p>issue was announced by lead manager UBS.</p>
<p> BORROWER   VOLKSWAGEN INTERNATIONAL FINANCE NV</p>
<p>GUARANTOR  VOLKSWAGEN AG</p>
<p> AMT	  $200 MLN  COUPON     3.00	MATURITY    24.JAN.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  PAR	 PAY DATE    24.JAN.97</p>
<p> NOTES	CONVERSION PREMIUM INDICATED AT 21-23 PERCENT.</p>
<p>		FINAL PRICING BY FRIDAY.</p>
<p> DENOMS (K) 10	  LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    SEMI-ANN</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
